ired to be single  widows and divorcees with no children  were considered but the airline wanted  to make sure that your job was the love  of your life only two years ago Qatar  Airways was still firing flight  attendants if they became pregnant or  got married within five years of  employment there was no place for love  in the air but there is no place for  hate either passing a background  investigation is also an important  requirement it covers everything about  you and can go back at least 10 years  your parking tickets probably won't be a  problem but if you ever decided to drive  a car while you were drunk they won't  trust you to work on a plane we agree  with this one this time  but cigarette smokers might not be happy  to hear that you have to be nicotine  free at least six months before sending  your application there will be no time  to take a break outside of the plane and  just like you should for any other job  clean up your social media if there are  any sexy selfies or pictures of you  partying too hard you might want to  delete them before your future boss sees  them a flight attendant has to be  perfect and professional all the time  even before getting the job the skills  these ladies and gentlemen don't only  have the beauty but the brains too  most airline to accept future flight  attendants who only have a high school  degree but as there are many people  competing against you you might want to  learn more about something that could be  relevant to do this job actually almost  50% of all flight attendants are also  college graduates many airlines are also  interested in someone who has some kind  of customer relations experience usually  at least two years when it comes to  strength you should be able to lift 50  pounds from the floor to your waist and  22 pounds above your head the cabin crew  from easyJet should also be able to swim  25 meters without any assistance and  tread water for at least a minute but  things become a little crazy when it  comes to training tam airlines puts  future flight attendants in a maze  filled with smoke in a totally dark  building they have to communicate with  each other in teams to find the dummy  hidden in the maze and then get him to  safety they also have to go through a  jungle survival training to see how they  can survive in nature if the plane  crashes however it is often useless to  go to a private school to be a flight  attendant the training is specific to  each airline as you will learn about  medical emergencies firefighting  evacuation water survival and much more  the personality on a plane everyone is  in a bad mood after spending hours  sitting on a seat and some people are  anxious that the plane might crash this  is why you need flight attendants with  the best personalities to deal with that  for example to work with Emirates groups  you have to fill up an online  personality questionnaire you have to be  confident positive  friendly flexible and very keen to help  others but a flight attendant from Air  Canada also said that one of the most  important things to do this job is being  a detached person you will be spending a  lot of time alone and you will always  have to adapt to new people new  environments and new regulations so you  have to be everyone's best friend only  for the time of a flight even when you  come back home you will have barely any  time to see your family hang out with  friends or go on dates as you will have  a lot of chores to do it is strange to  think that air hostesses are surrounded  by people all the time but are still  some of the loneliest persons in the  world no matter what our best advice is  to always be yourself if you pretend to  be someone else during the interview you  won't be happy in the long run when you  realize that this job isn't for you  working as a flight attendant is not  something that you do it is something  that you are the application we already  talked about looks and it starts as soon  as you send your application the first  impression matters and you need to look  like you are already ready to be applied  attendant Emirates groups described in  detail all the things that you have to  wear for your picture and your interview  and even how to do your makeup some of  the grooming guidelines requirements  include her neatly tied in a French roll  of French manicure and a skirt that  should be one inch below the knee and  close toe heels you need to start by  sending your application online and  respect a lot of the guidelines then you  will get your video interview and it is  time to shine as much as you would do in  person many candidates have the chance  to fly to the country where they will be  doing the assessment day don't forget  that the interview starts as soon as you  enter the room so you want to look your  best and be friendly to everyone it is  surprising to hear that one of the most  important things is not to stand out you  need to do exactly what they want you to  do and dress exactly as they expect you  to just like anyone else you want to  show that you will conform to every  guideline so always smile sell yourself  talk about your best qualities but make  sure that you always correspond to their  ideal flight attendant the makeup every  detail matters when you are flight  attendant and  during the makeup usually you need to  have a professional and conventional  look but some airlines are much more  specific first scars pimples and  blemishes are not acceptable if you have  some make sure that no one can notice it  when you do your makeup you should also  have no visible tattoo but this time  don't even try to hide it because they  won't accept that you cover it each  airline has different guidelines for  grooming for examples lipstick and gloss  are required for air hostesses but it is  specified that men cannot wear makeup  pens and nails should be groomed at all  times and can't exceed an eighth of an  inch beyond the fingertip you also need  to remove any visible hair nostrils or  ears mustaches cannot be longer than 1/4  of an inch below the sides of the mouth  and trendy facial hair styles are not  permitted men and women cannot dye their  hair in unnatural color hair styles like  dreadlocks topknots  cornrows and Mohawks are also not  permitted moreover flight attendants  must have a full frontal complement of  clean teeth and use breath sprays or  mints that's a lot of things to remember  if you thought that there were too many  rules at private high schools you are  not ready to become a flight attendant  the uniform so when your makeup is ready  you need to dress up and once again if  there are too many specific guidelines  airlines have high standards because  their clients have high standards they  worked hard and spent a lot of money to  choose the right uniform for their brand  and bright uniform standards this is why  you should respect them these guidelines  include not only your skirt and your  shirt but also your undergarments and  the shape of your shoe healed each  airline has different rules for example  the maximum hosiery density is 15 denier  you cannot wear more than two rings on  each hand and hoop earrings should not  be larger than one and a half inches in  diameter and half an inch wide on the  surface accessories are usually not  permitted the only exception is a watch  and you are limited to specific colors  this skirt must not be more than one  inch above or one inch below the NIEM if  you have a sweater  you can't tie it around your waist but  only around your shoulders and remember  that no matter how you move everything  must stay in place we can't believe that  someone thought about all of these  things but no matter what we think that  it is comforting to immediately  recognize a flight attendant when we see  one the perfection  do you think that flight attendants look  perfect all the time and it is not easy  to be you have to be a role model as  soon as you put