t the start of your career if the  economy is bad or if they hire too many  people around 70% of flight attendants  have been laid off at least once in  their career no matter if they had a lot  of experience or not little to no  stability is to be expected with this  job even if you have to make a lot of  sacrifices to become an air host  the commitment the main reason why most  people can't become flight attendants is  that they don't want to leave behind the  life that they already have many air  hostesses have to leave their country  and their family to move on to a new  continent or they don't know anyone it  might be beautiful to travel the world  but it is not always fun when you do it  on your own when you were up in the air  all the time all you can do when you  come back home is sleep and do some  chores so don't even think about seeing  anyone else than your roommates unless  you were on vacation  you can't even plan to see your family  on holiday unless you have years of  seniority this is probably why it is not  a good idea to be dating someone but no  matter what this is a great opportunity  to save money and enjoy life during the  few weeks that you are not working  traveling the world is also seeing new  cities every day and discovering new  cultures it is meeting people that you  will never see again but who can become  your friends in one flight so if you are  ready to live this unique adventure on  your own being a flight attendant might  be for you and that's it for 10 strange  requirements to work as a flight  attendant if you want to see more  stories like this don't forget to watch  10 secret flight attendants don't want  you to know thanks for watching  [Music]

